    "text": "By Kerry Justich ,\n7 hours ago Clarissa, 25, has been an Ariana Grande fan for years. She grew up watching the singer evolve from Nickelodeon mainstay to global superstar, as Grande put out albums, navigated public relationships and most recently, starred in the blockbuster Wicked adaptations. So when Grande released her latest music video for her new single \"Petal,\" Clarissa expected to watch it. Instead, she skipped it. Read full article",
